    <string name="about_app_text">This app will help you discover the best places in Izhevsk — from cozy coffee shops and restaurants with Udmurt cuisine to scenic parks, shopping centers and family-friendly attractions.</string>
    <string name="about_city_text">Izhevsk is the capital of the Udmurt Republic, a major industrial and cultural center of Russia. Founded in 1760 as a settlement around an iron foundry. The city is known as the birthplace of Mikhail Kalashnikov, designer of the famous AK-47. Home to over 640,000 people, the city is rich in Udmurt traditions and culture.</string>

